#N canvas 0 50 760 420 10;
#X text 10 5 Desktop control simulator. Sends the same names as the Nebulae via [s name] (no TCP needed).;
#X text 10 20 Open in the same Pd session as an instrument \, or use sim/send_fudi.py over TCP 3000.;
